OL,3,CPolice appeal for information after
OL,4,Ccar hits trees in 'serious collision'
OL,5,Con A38
OL,7,FDerbyshire Police is asking anyone
OL,8,Fwith information about a "serious
OL,9,Fcollision" to come forward after an
OL,10,Fincident on the A38 in Derby yesterday
OL,11,Fevening (Saturday 25 July).
OL,13,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,14,Fscene on a stretch of the road between
OL,15,Fthe A50 Toyota Island and the A516 at
OL,16,Fabout 11pm.
OL,18,FOfficers responded to reports that a
OL,19,Fred Hyundai car, containing five
OL,20,Fpeople, had left the carriageway and
OL,21,Fcrashed into trees.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/2
