OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785104278
OL,3,CPolice appeal for information after
OL,4,Ccar hits trees in 'serious collision'
OL,5,Con A38
OL,7,FThe road was closed for several hours
OL,8,Fwhile emergency services dealt with
OL,9,Fthe incident but it has since been
OL,10,Freopened.
OL,12,FPolice are asking any witnesses or
OL,13,Fanyone with dashcam footage to contact
OL,14,Fthem.
OL,16,FThe condition of the passengers is not
OL,17,Fknown.
OL,19,FITV Central has contacted East
OL,20,FMidlands Ambulance Service for a
OL,21,Fstatement.
